# Backend Quality Gates

Before any build or merge:

1. `npm run lint` — 0 errors, 0 warnings
2. `npm run audit:check` — 0 vulnerabilities
3. `npm run deps:check` — dependencies match semver `wanted` versions
4. `npm run build` runs all checks automatically via `validate`

Never weaken ESLint rules to bypass warnings. Fix the code instead.
